  "about_item": [
    "POWERFUL SANITIZING PERFORMANCE: Wondercide’s Multi-Surface Disinfectant kills 99.99% of bacteria, viruses and fungi, including E. coli, Salmonella, Staph, Klebsiella pneumoniae, Listeria, MRSA, SARS-CoV-2 and Trichophyton interdigitale. This disinfecting spray tackles everyday household germs while killing odors at the source.",
    "HEALTHIER WAY TO CLEAN WITH GENTLE AND SIMPLE INGREDIENTS: Made from salt, water, and electricity, this innovative formula breaks down into a saline solution after use - no harsh chemical residues, fumes, or overpowering odors, making it ideal for everyday cleaning.",
    "SANITIZES FOOD-CONTACT SURFACES - NO RINSING REQUIRED: This sanitizer spray sanitizes food contact surfaces without rinsing, making it gentle enough to use on any washable hard, non-porous surface including kitchen counters, appliances, sinks, highchairs, utensils, pet bowls and feeding dishes, dog or cat chew toys, and high-touch areas where cleanliness matters most.",
    "MULTI-SURFACE AND HOUSEHOLD VERSATILITY: Perfect for kitchens, bathrooms, showers, toilet seats, litter boxes, kennels, indoor playgrounds, and pet areas. This rinse free disinfectant spray can be used on glass, stainless steel, glazed ceramic tile, glazed porcelain, sealed granite or marble, vinyl tile, plastic laminate, sealed fiberglass, chrome, and finished wood. Will not whiten or bleach surfaces or clothes.",
    "WORRY-FREE CONVENIENCE: This ready-to-use antibacterial spray requires no gloves or special equipment. Simply spray, let air dry, and relax - that’s it! No dyes, no fragrances, no harsh fumes to irritate pet noses, and no worries about your pet licking after cleaning. Disinfect fearlessly with a powerful cleaning essential for busy households to support easy, daily germ control, when used as directed."
  ],
