      {
        "position": 7,
        "title": "5 star assumes you know what this is - it's not a cleaner, it's a disinfectant",
        "text": "This is not a replacement for simply green or fabuloso, this is a disinfectant, and a high maintenance one at that. This is a replacement for something like bleach, that you would use to disinfect, but safe, so think food surfaces, kids meal trays, pet food bowls AFTER you clean them.It is also a bit high maintenance, it is not a spray and wipe, it is a spray, let sit for a few minutes, then wipe.However, these complexities are only a downside if you don't know what this is and try to use it in place of whatever spray cleaner you have now. It is a very effective and safe disinfectant, with very specific usage.That said, it is a good product. I use it on pet bowls and as a final spray when my dog has an accident. I use it on plastic cutting boards as well.Smells clean, smells honestly a bit like clorox, but more mild.The reason I take a star off is both because it is a bit pricey and because Hypochlorous Acid breaks down with time. I wish the bottle had a use by date - after a certain point, it is just water, and I won't know when it is no longer effective.",
        "rating": 4,
